#!/usr/bin/env node
// t3listen - tells T3 Tots the moment a T3 Code thread asks a question (and when it's answered or closed),
// and when a thread's run finishes, fails or is cancelled (sub-task threads only when they fail; usage-limit stops in
// projects listed in autoresume.json, or in threads T3 Tots started, get T3's "Resume at reset" armed, see autoResumeSet),
// by POSTing JSON to the webhook in listen.json. No polling: it follows T3's live event stream. Needs Node 22+.
