}

// ---------- run ends: finished / failed / cancelled ----------
// One event per run (keyed by run id in listen-state.json "finished", kept 14 days), so restarts never repeat one.
// "finished"/"cancelled" only when the thread is left idle (a queued message starting next is not an end); "failed" always.
// Sub-task threads (id "thread:delegated-task:...") are reported only when they fail.
